SUMMARY:2026 FIFA World Cup Final Game Party! (with Food and Drink Special
 s) (July 19th)
DESCRIPTION:NATURE WALKS and FRIENDLY TALKS with SINGLES!\nGood day everyo
 ne\,\n\nPlease join us for a great day as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **the 
 World Cup Final Game!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we
  can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy t
 he big game with!\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 2:00 pm and 3:
 00 pm**\n\\*Includes Mix\, Mingle and Board games at 1:00 pm and Patio Din
 ner Party after the Soccer game at 5:30 pm :)\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\n
 Sincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**2026 
 FIFA World Cup Final Game Party! (with Food and Drink Specials) (Sunday\, 
 July 19th)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food and the W
 orld Cup Finals Party!\n-Amazing people\, resereved seating\, great food a
 nd beverages\n(Lots of Big Screen TV's to catch the game)\n-Complimentary 
 Pool Table\, and Food and Drink specials too\n-Swag and prizes included :)
 \n\\*Plenty of parking all around the venue\n-Free Parking on Mt. Pleasant
  north of Eglinton and -Free Parking on Eglinton (Just west of Mt. Pleasan
 t)\n\\*Stick around after for the Patio Dinner party too :)\n\n**Friendly 
 Reminders:**\n-Arrive any time between 2:00 pm and 3:30 pm inside the rest
 aurant (ask or look for Steve/Organizer when you arrive for our reserved s
 ection)\n(1 minute walk from the new Eglinton station at Mt. Pleasant)\n\n
 **Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\n
 or e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemmi
 ng11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please to support the
  staff and restaurant)\nFee includes Board Games event\, the Soccer Match 
 and the Patio Dinner Party after the game :)
